1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,380
Delhi ke smog se bachne ke liye mehenga

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,100
air purifier zaroori nahi.

3
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:06,420
Yeh dhool itni chhoti hai ki phephdon se

4
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:07,830
khoon tak pahunch jaati hai,

5
00:00:07,850 --> 00:00:10,590
par 5 saste tareeke isse kaafi had tak rok

6
00:00:10,610 --> 00:00:11,250
sakte hain.

7
00:00:11,270 --> 00:00:12,750
Pehla, sahi mask.

8
00:00:12,850 --> 00:00:15,120
Kapde ka mask is dhool ko nahi rokta.

9
00:00:15,170 --> 00:00:17,210
Sasta sa N95 mask lo,

10
00:00:17,230 --> 00:00:19,610
aur naak pe clip daba ke bilkul fit karo,

11
00:00:19,630 --> 00:00:21,045
taaki side se hawa na aaye.

12
00:00:21,065 --> 00:00:23,080
Doosra, khidki ka sahi time.

13
00:00:23,120 --> 00:00:25,040
Smog ke time khidkiyan band rakho.

14
00:00:25,060 --> 00:00:27,850
Hawa badalni ho, toh AQI dekh ke kholo,

15
00:00:27,870 --> 00:00:30,010
aksar dopahar mein hawa thodi behtar hoti

16
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:30,330
hai.

17
00:00:30,350 --> 00:00:32,740
Teesra, jhaadu ki jagah geela pochha.

18
00:00:32,810 --> 00:00:34,810
Jhaadu se zameen ki dhool phir se hawa

19
00:00:34,830 --> 00:00:35,680
mein udti hai.

20
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:37,670
Geela pochha use pakad leta hai.

21
00:00:37,690 --> 00:00:40,100
Chautha, ghar ke andar ka dhuaan band.

22
00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:42,050
Agarbatti, machhar wali coil,

23
00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:43,980
cigarette, yeh sab ghar mein hi pollution

24
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:44,870
badhate hain.

25
00:00:44,890 --> 00:00:47,150
Aur tadka lagate waqt exhaust ya chimney

26
00:00:47,170 --> 00:00:48,110
zaroor chalao.

27
00:00:48,130 --> 00:00:50,470
Aur paanchva, apna sasta air purifier.

28
00:00:50,490 --> 00:00:53,000
Ek table fan ke peeche achha air filter

29
00:00:53,020 --> 00:00:53,660
laga do.

30
00:00:53,680 --> 00:00:55,920
Research mein aise ghar ke bane filter fan

31
00:00:55,940 --> 00:00:57,920
bhi ghar ki hawa saaf karte paaye gaye

32
00:00:57,940 --> 00:00:58,170
hain.

33
00:00:58,190 --> 00:00:59,890
Filter ka naam description mein hai.

34
00:00:59,910 --> 00:01:02,400
Toh N95, sahi time pe khidki,

35
00:01:02,420 --> 00:01:04,300
geela pochha, ghar mein dhuaan nahi,

36
00:01:04,320 --> 00:01:05,640
aur fan wala filter.

37
00:01:05,740 --> 00:01:07,220
Aur agar saans mein dikkat ho,

38
00:01:07,240 --> 00:01:08,790
toh doctor ko zaroor dikhayein.

39
00:01:08,810 --> 00:01:11,150
Aise roz ke "kyun" ke liye Whysplained ko

40
00:01:11,170 --> 00:01:12,220
subscribe karo!
